			<trans-unit id="courses.registerNow" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Register for this course now</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoPresenceHeader" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Information about registration and cancellation:</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoPresenceText1" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Deadline for registration is 2 weeks before the date of the event. The number of participants per training day is limited. After confirmation of participation by LST and payment of the invoice, your registration is binding. (Terms of payment: Receipt of invoice, to be transferred no later than 7 days before the start of the event). Cancellation of your participation is possible in writing until 2 weeks before the date of the event with full refund of costs. Cancellations after this deadline will be charged in full.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoPresenceText2" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>We reserve the right to cancel an event if the number of participants is too low or the lecturer is ill. In this case you will be informed immediately. A full refund of the course fee will be given. We reserve the right to make changes to the course schedule.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoPresenceText3" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>LST is not liable for accidents, or loss or theft of or damage to items brought to the course. LST accepts no liability for damage caused by participants.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoOnlineHeader" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Information about registration for and deregistration from the online training course:</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoOnlineText1" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>After the registration has been checked by the Labor Strauss Group, an invoice will be issued – payment due date: immediately and without deductions.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoOnlineText2" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Registration for the chosen course and activation of the participant usually takes place one working day after invoicing.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoOnlineText3" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Upon activation of the course, the participant will be informed personally by email. From this point onwards, the participant has 90 days to complete the course successfully and receive his/her certificate</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoOnlineText4" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>91 days after registration, the participant can no longer access the course. The acquired certificate remains valid.</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoLiveOnlineHeader" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>Information about registration for and deregistration from the online training course:</source>
			</trans-unit>
			<trans-unit id="courses.addInfoLiveOnlineText1" xml:space="preserve">
				<source>After the registration has been checked by the Labor Strauss Group, an invoice will be issued – payment due date: immediately and without deductions.</source>
